## A. Rename "answer key" → "coverage bar"

All occurrences in `slides/manuscript/main.tex` (re-grep; current sites):
- `:535` subsection heading "\textbf{An answer key already in the training
  corpus.}" → "\textbf{A coverage bar already in the training corpus.}"
- `:514`, `:537`, `:554`, `:563`, `:566`, `:568` — "the answer key" →
